# S2, member b (k10): one second after a through the gate, west with a, stays when a leaves by matz02 and follows
# 15 s later (alone in its instance: the original exit, then a JOIN of a's stag0102 instance), back with a.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@91
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west:-280,-190}
wander -280 -190 6 until present=1
log a left
wander -280 -190 6 until frames>=900
mat matz02 yes until stage=stag0102,control
log in stag0102 with a
mat matz01 yes 2 until stage=stag0101,control
log together back in stag0101
wander -300 -210 15 until sealed>=2400 or present=1,frames>=60
log enough
idle until frames>=60
